From: pocket_vm developers <pocket-vm@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] um: remove the now unused free_irqs() declaration

free_irqs() no longer exists: the previous patch replaced it with a static
work-item drain inside arch/um/drivers/chan_kern.c, and nothing outside that
file calls it.
---
 arch/um/include/shared/irq_kern.h | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/um/include/shared/irq_kern.h b/arch/um/include/shared/irq_kern.h
index 44357fa6ee29..f2dc817abb7c 100644
--- a/arch/um/include/shared/irq_kern.h
+++ b/arch/um/include/shared/irq_kern.h
@@ -76,5 +76,4 @@ static inline bool um_irq_timetravel_handler_used(void)
 }
 
 void um_free_irq(int irq, void *dev_id);
-void free_irqs(void);
 #endif
